  "claim": "The al-Qaeda terrorist group was the cause of the battle in which Mark E. Michell won an award for his actions.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Mark E. Mitchell. Sentence: In 2003, he received the award for his actions during the Battle of Qala-i-Jangi, which took place in late November – early December 2001.\nPage: Battle of Qala-i-Jangi. Sentence: The Battle of Qala-i-Jangi (also incorrectly referred to as the \"Battle of Mazar-i-Sharif\") was a prisoner-of-war camp uprising that took place between November 25 and December 1, 2001, in northern Afghanistan, following the armed intervention by United States-led coalition forces to try to overthrow the Taliban's Islamic Emirate of Afghanistan, which it had accused of harboring al-Qaeda operatives.",
  "evidence_text": "Page: Mark E. Mitchell. Sentence: In 2003, he received the award for his actions during the Battle of Qala-i-Jangi, which took place in late November – early December 2001.\nPage: Battle of Qala-i-Jangi. Sentence: The Battle of Qala-i-Jangi (also incorrectly referred to as the \"Battle of Mazar-i-Sharif\") was a prisoner-of-war camp uprising that took place between November 25 and December 1, 2001, in northern Afghanistan, following the armed intervention by United States-led coalition forces to try to overthrow the Taliban's Islamic Emirate of Afghanistan, which it had accused of harboring al-Qaeda operatives.",
